sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Peripheral<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    Product->>CN: GapPeripheral.GetAdvertisingAddress()
    alt Privacy disabled (or Advertise never called and still in standby)
        CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.AdvertisingAddress(<br>address=00:1A:7D:DA:71:13, addressType=publicAddress)
        Note over Product: Returns the identity address.
    else Privacy enabled and CN has advertised at least once
        CN-->>Product: GapPeripheralResponse.AdvertisingAddress(<br>address=6C:8B:2F:3A:9D:41, addressType=randomAddress)
        Note over Product: Returns the resolvable private address currently in use.<br>Rotated periodically by the BLE stack.
    end
